The {{Term/Store|Rubber Armor||Series, BotW, TotK, AoC}} is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Rubber Armor can be acquired in the [[Toh Yahsa Shrine]] after completing the "[[Trial of Thunder]]" [[Shrine Quest]] on the [[Thundra Plateau]]. It provides [[Link]] with three [[Defense]] and one level of [[Shock Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> It can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and [[Hateno Dye|Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Rubber Armor, alongside the [[Rubber Helm]] and [[Rubber Tights]], compose the [[Armor Set]] of the same name, the [[Rubber Armor (Set)|Rubber Armor]]. When each piece of the Set has been enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides the [[Unshockable]] [[Set Bonus]].

